{"book":11,"chapter":26,"rubric":"MODERN FRONTEND / JAVASCRIPT IN THE BROWSER / CHAPTER 18","slides":[{"title":"The Network as a Base","sub":"Chapter 26 · Browser and Server","short":"Intro","main":"The network is the base of frontend.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Data","Chapter sections","Practice"],"captions":["Almost every app lives on server data, so working with the network is the base of frontend","fetch and its objects, cancelling and retries, CORS, caching, authorization, protocol versions, WebSocket and Server-Sent Events","In the exercises: header parsing, retries, a CORS check, a cache with conditional requests, an event stream parser and a WebSocket client"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":80.0,"y":70.0,"w":100.0,"h":40.0,"text":"browser","tone":"yellow","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"a","x1":132.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":228.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"s","x":280.0,"y":70.0,"w":100.0,"h":40.0,"text":"server","tone":"green","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"t0","x":66.0,"y":56.0,"w":100.0,"h":28.0,"text":"fetch","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"t1","x":180.0,"y":56.0,"w":100.0,"h":28.0,"text":"cancel","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"t2","x":294.0,"y":56.0,"w":100.0,"h":28.0,"text":"CORS","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"t3","x":66.0,"y":100.0,"w":100.0,"h":28.0,"text":"cache","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"t4","x":180.0,"y":100.0,"w":100.0,"h":28.0,"text":"WebSocket","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"t5","x":294.0,"y":100.0,"w":100.0,"h":28.0,"text":"SSE","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"code","id":"c~code","x":30.0,"y":36.0,"lines":["parseHeaders(raw)","retry(fn, { tries })","parseSSE(chunk)","createSocket(url)"],"hl":[0,2],"lang":"js","size":11.0,"lh":24.0,"w":300.0}]],"cues":[14.4,30.6]}]},{"title":"fetch","sub":"Request, Response, Headers","short":"fetch","main":"A 404 is not a fetch error.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["From XHR to fetch","Three objects","Status 404 is not an error"],"captions":["Before there was XMLHttpRequest with callbacks; the modern way is the fetch function returning a promise with a response","Around fetch live Request, Response and Headers","The promise rejects only on a network error; a 404 or 500 response is a normal response, check success via res.ok"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"x","x":90.0,"y":70.0,"w":120.0,"h":40.0,"text":"XMLHttpRequest","tone":"red","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"a","x1":152.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":208.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"f","x":270.0,"y":70.0,"w":100.0,"h":40.0,"text":"fetch → Promise","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"o0","x":66.0,"y":70.0,"w":100.0,"h":40.0,"text":"Request","tone":"blue","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"o1","x":180.0,"y":70.0,"w":100.0,"h":40.0,"text":"Response","tone":"blue","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"o2","x":294.0,"y":70.0,"w":100.0,"h":40.0,"text":"Headers","tone":"blue","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":30.0,"lines":["const res = await fetch(url);","if (!res.ok) {","  throw new Error(res.status);","}"],"hl":[1,2],"lang":"js","size":10.5,"lh":24.0,"w":330.0},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":140.0,"text":"reject — only on a network error","size":9.5}]],"cues":[11.8,24.1]}]},{"title":"Request and Response","sub":"Body, json(), clone()","short":"Body","main":"The body is read once.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Request body","Reading the response","Only once"],"captions":["Method, headers and body: a string, JSON, FormData, Blob or buffer; JSON needs Content-Type and serialization","A response is read via json(), text(), blob() or arrayBuffer()","The body is read once — for a second copy call clone() before reading; headers are case-insensitive"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":16.0,"y":28.0,"lines":["fetch('/api', {","  method: 'POST',","  headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },","  body: JSON.stringify(data),","});"],"hl":[1,2,3],"lang":"js","size":9.5,"lh":22.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"m0","x":66.0,"y":56.0,"w":100.0,"h":28.0,"text":"json()","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"m1","x":180.0,"y":56.0,"w":100.0,"h":28.0,"text":"text()","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"m2","x":66.0,"y":100.0,"w":100.0,"h":28.0,"text":"blob()","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"m3","x":180.0,"y":100.0,"w":100.0,"h":28.0,"text":"arrayBuffer()","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":30.0,"y":34.0,"lines":["const copy = res.clone();","await res.json();","await copy.text();","await res.text(); // error"],"hl":[3],"lang":"js","size":10.0,"lh":24.0,"w":320.0}]],"cues":[13.4,18.3]}]},{"title":"Streams","sub":"ReadableStream, buffer","short":"Streams","main":"Chunks pile up in a buffer.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Stream","Accumulating","Chunk boundaries"],"captions":["The body is a stream: the reader hands out chunks of bytes as they arrive, so download progress can be shown","Accumulated bytes are compared with Content-Length; text is decoded piece by piece via TextDecoder","A chunk can cut a character or a line in the middle, so the remainder piles up in a buffer; fetch can't track upload progress"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"s","x":70.0,"y":70.0,"w":90.0,"h":34.0,"text":"server","tone":"green","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"k0","x":166.0,"y":70.0,"w":30.0,"h":26.0,"text":"▮","tone":"blue","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"k1","x":202.0,"y":70.0,"w":30.0,"h":26.0,"text":"▮","tone":"blue","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"k2","x":238.0,"y":70.0,"w":30.0,"h":26.0,"text":"▮","tone":"blue","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"r","x":316.0,"y":70.0,"w":56.0,"h":34.0,"text":"reader","tone":"yellow","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"bar","x":180.0,"y":56.0,"w":260.0,"h":16.0,"text":"","tone":"muted","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"fill","x":118.0,"y":56.0,"w":134.0,"h":16.0,"text":"","tone":"green","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"p","x":180.0,"y":94.0,"text":"60% · 600 of 1000 bytes","size":10.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":100.0,"y":70.0,"w":130.0,"h":34.0,"text":"«str»","tone":"blue","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":260.0,"y":70.0,"w":130.0,"h":34.0,"text":"«ing\\n»","tone":"blue","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e","x1":168.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":192.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":124.0,"text":"remainder — to buffer","size":10.0}]],"cues":[7.7,21.8]}]},{"title":"Cancel and Retry","sub":"AbortController, backoff","short":"Cancel","main":"Retry only the idempotent.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["AbortController","Timeout","Retries"],"captions":["Pass the controller's signal into the request; abort() breaks the connection, the promise rejects with AbortError","There is a ready signal for timeouts, AbortSignal.timeout(ms); it cancels stale search and page exits","Retry only safe and idempotent requests, with a growing delay and random jitter"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":16.0,"y":34.0,"lines":["const ctrl = new AbortController();","fetch(url, { signal: ctrl.signal });","ctrl.abort();"],"hl":[2],"lang":"js","size":10.0,"lh":26.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":40.0,"lines":["fetch(url, {","  signal: AbortSignal.timeout(3000),","});"],"hl":[1],"lang":"js","size":10.5,"lh":26.0,"w":330.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"d0","x":56.0,"y":80.0,"w":66.0,"h":24.0,"text":"100 ms","tone":"blue","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"d1","x":138.0,"y":70.0,"w":66.0,"h":38.0,"text":"200 ms","tone":"blue","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"d2","x":220.0,"y":60.0,"w":66.0,"h":52.0,"text":"400 ms","tone":"blue","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"d3","x":302.0,"y":50.0,"w":66.0,"h":66.0,"text":"800 ms","tone":"red","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":146.0,"text":"delay grows + jitter","size":10.0}]],"cues":[13.1,23.2]}]},{"title":"CORS","sub":"Origin and preflight","short":"CORS","main":"CORS is set by the server.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Origin","Preflight","Credentials"],"captions":["An origin is scheme, host and port; a page can't read a foreign origin's responses until the server allows it with Access-Control-Allow-Origin","For non-simple requests the browser first sends OPTIONS and asks which methods and headers are allowed; the answer can be cached","With cookies you need credentials and an exact origin instead of an asterisk; CORS is configured only on the server"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":60.0,"w":130.0,"h":30.0,"text":"https://app.ru:443","tone":"yellow","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":270.0,"y":60.0,"w":130.0,"h":30.0,"text":"https://api.ru:443","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e","x1":156.0,"y1":60.0,"x2":204.0,"y2":60.0,"tone":"red","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":116.0,"text":"Allow-Origin: https://app.ru","size":10.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":70.0,"y":40.0,"w":90.0,"h":28.0,"text":"browser","tone":"yellow","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":290.0,"y":40.0,"w":90.0,"h":28.0,"text":"server","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"p","x1":118.0,"y1":54.0,"x2":242.0,"y2":54.0,"tone":"blue","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"text","id":"t","x":180.0,"y":84.0,"text":"OPTIONS (preflight)","size":10.0},{"t":"text","id":"u","x":180.0,"y":108.0,"text":"Allow-Methods · Allow-Headers","size":9.5},{"t":"text","id":"v","x":180.0,"y":130.0,"text":"Max-Age: 600","size":9.5}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":16.0,"y":28.0,"lines":["fetch(url, { credentials: 'include' });","","Allow-Origin: https://app.ru","Allow-Credentials: true","Vary: Origin"],"hl":[2,3,4],"lang":"js","size":9.5,"lh":22.0,"w":340.0}]],"cues":[18.5,34.8]}]},{"title":"Caching","sub":"Cache-Control and ETag","short":"Cache","main":"A 304 saves traffic.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Cache-Control","Conditional request","Background refresh"],"captions":["Cache-Control sets the lifetime and rules: max-age, no-store, mandatory revalidation","When time is up, the browser sends If-None-Match with the ETag; the server answers 304 without a body if the data hasn't changed","The stale-while-revalidate pattern: serve the stale copy at once and refresh in the background; fetch has cache modes"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":30.0,"y":40.0,"lines":["Cache-Control: max-age=3600","Cache-Control: no-store","Cache-Control: no-cache"],"hl":[0],"lang":"js","size":10.5,"lh":26.0,"w":300.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":50.0,"w":150.0,"h":26.0,"text":"If-None-Match: \"v7\"","tone":"yellow","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e","x1":180.0,"y1":80.0,"x2":180.0,"y2":104.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":90.0,"y":128.0,"w":150.0,"h":26.0,"text":"304 Not Modified","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"c~cell","x":70.0,"y":70.0,"w":90.0,"h":34.0,"text":"cache: instantly","tone":"yellow","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n","x":290.0,"y":70.0,"w":110.0,"h":34.0,"text":"network: later","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e","x1":120.0,"y1":90.0,"x2":240.0,"y2":90.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6}]],"cues":[11.8,26.4]}]},{"title":"Authorization","sub":"Cookies and tokens","short":"Auth","main":"One token refresh for everyone.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Cookies","Token","Refresh"],"captions":["The first way is session cookies: the browser attaches them to same-site requests, protection is SameSite and tokens against forgery","The second is the Authorization header with a token that the app stores and attaches itself","401 — refresh the token once and repeat; 403 — access denied, retrying is pointless; parallel requests share one refresh"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":80.0,"y":70.0,"w":90.0,"h":34.0,"text":"browser","tone":"yellow","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":280.0,"y":70.0,"w":90.0,"h":34.0,"text":"server","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e","x1":128.0,"y1":64.0,"x2":232.0,"y2":64.0,"tone":"blue","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"text","id":"t","x":180.0,"y":100.0,"text":"Cookie: sid=…","size":10.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":44.0,"lines":["fetch(url, {","  headers: {","    Authorization: `Bearer ${token}`,","  },","});"],"hl":[2],"lang":"js","size":10.0,"lh":22.0,"w":330.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"s0","x":56.0,"y":70.0,"w":70.0,"h":30.0,"text":"request","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"s1","x":138.0,"y":70.0,"w":70.0,"h":30.0,"text":"401","tone":"red","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"s2","x":220.0,"y":70.0,"w":70.0,"h":30.0,"text":"refresh","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"s3","x":302.0,"y":70.0,"w":70.0,"h":30.0,"text":"retry","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[13.6,19.9]}]},{"title":"HTTP/2 and HTTP/3","sub":"Multiplexing and QUIC","short":"HTTP","main":"Turned on at the server and CDN.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["HTTP/1.1","HTTP/2","HTTP/3"],"captions":["Version 1.1 opens many connections and waits for responses in turn","Version 2 multiplexes many requests in one connection and compresses headers","Version 3 runs on QUIC and UDP and doesn't suffer from losing one packet; it is enabled at the server and CDN, the client gets Brotli"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"c0","x":180.0,"y":40.0,"w":250.0,"h":22.0,"text":"connection 1: request → response","tone":"blue","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c1","x":180.0,"y":76.0,"w":250.0,"h":22.0,"text":"connection 2: request → response","tone":"blue","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c2","x":180.0,"y":112.0,"w":250.0,"h":22.0,"text":"connection 3: request → response","tone":"blue","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":180.0,"y":70.0,"w":280.0,"h":70.0,"text":"","tone":"muted","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"s0","x":180.0,"y":50.0,"w":260.0,"h":14.0,"text":"stream 1","tone":"green","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"s1","x":180.0,"y":70.0,"w":260.0,"h":14.0,"text":"stream 2","tone":"green","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"s2","x":180.0,"y":90.0,"w":260.0,"h":14.0,"text":"stream 3","tone":"green","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"u","x":100.0,"y":70.0,"w":100.0,"h":40.0,"text":"UDP","tone":"yellow","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"q","x":240.0,"y":70.0,"w":110.0,"h":40.0,"text":"QUIC + TLS","tone":"green","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e","x1":154.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":184.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"blue","arrow":true,"width":1.6}]],"cues":[7.6,25.5]}]},{"title":"WebSocket","sub":"Two-way channel","short":"WebSocket","main":"Reconnecting is the client's job.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Handshake","Events","Reconnecting"],"captions":["An ordinary request with Upgrade: websocket, the 101 response — and frames go both ways over the same channel","Events open, message, error and close; close has a code and a reason","The channel doesn't reconnect itself: the client does it with exponential delay, pings and a queue of accumulated messages"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":70.0,"y":40.0,"w":90.0,"h":26.0,"text":"GET + Upgrade","tone":"yellow","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":290.0,"y":40.0,"w":90.0,"h":26.0,"text":"101","tone":"green","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e1","x1":118.0,"y1":40.0,"x2":242.0,"y2":40.0,"tone":"blue","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"l","x":180.0,"y":100.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"↔ frames both ways ↔","tone":"blue","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":